# DRC-CIF-4: cifarea VIA1 10000 50; m1c squares generating small vias.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 20 20
paint m1c
box 100 0 300 200
paint m1c
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
